Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.80,0:01:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that's when it happened!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.80,0:02:01.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I looked him straight in the eye and yelled,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.17,0:02:04.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"You bowlegged bastard!"
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.07,0:02:05.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And ever since that day,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.54,0:02:07.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,crabs throughout\Nthe world have been
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.08,0:02:08.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,self-conscious about\Nbeing bowlegged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:10.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.08,0:02:12.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the reason they walk sideways?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.37,0:02:14.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep.\NAnd at that pivotal moment,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.14,0:02:15.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a lobster happened\Nto be within earshot
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.90,0:02:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and heard the whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.44,0:02:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So lobsters are crabs too?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.00,0:02:22.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Better believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:23.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.94,0:02:26.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro. Why don't you relax?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.71,0:02:28.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just wasting your energy doing that.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.78,0:02:29.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who asked you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.98,0:02:32.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excuse him, Nami. He's hopeless.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.75,0:02:34.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys like Zoro...\Nthey gotta keep moving
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or they won't stay focused.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.71,0:02:39.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have one-track minds,\N'specially...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.12,0:02:43.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...our own resident\Nmuscle-freak, here,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.99,0:02:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,now that he's had a taste of the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.47,0:02:48.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop whining.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.41,0:02:51.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just say what's on\Nyour mind, or shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.64,0:02:53.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, you need me to spell it out?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.01,0:02:56.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All this tough-guy bluster\Nis just a sad attempt
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.65,0:02:59.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to mask your fear that\NLuffy might lose this one.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sayin' I'm scared? Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.35,0:03:04.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're sayin'?\NLook at me!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.39,0:03:05.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fancy eyebrows!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.32,0:03:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it!\NI've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.43,0:03:09.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya damn moss-head!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you call me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.53,0:03:13.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You wanna go at it?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! This is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.03,0:03:20.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.16,0:03:22.40,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They're at each other's throats.\NEveryone's worked up.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.43,0:03:25.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's up to me, as vice-captain,\Nto take charge.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.40,0:03:27.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down! All of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone's frightened, yes,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.12,0:03:31.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but we mustn't turn on each other!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.10,0:03:33.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy's counting on us to meet him in Alubarna!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.54,0:03:36.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you seem more\Non-edge than any of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.27,0:03:42.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep your mind on the rebellion\Nand leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.14,0:03:44.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.04,0:03:47.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we tear each other apart, we've already lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.85,0:03:49.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, that's settled.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.31,0:03:51.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, let's devote our\Nattention to Alubarna!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.95,0:03:53.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Full speed, Scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:54.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.40,0:03:57.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Scissors"?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.37,0:03:58.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Name for the crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:03:59.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.51,0:04:00.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just make that up?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.94,0:04:01.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got something better?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.01,0:04:02.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.77,0:04:15.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water!\NI can hardly believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.41,0:04:19.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Precious water.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.41,0:04:22.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The water is coming forth!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.15,0:04:26.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.65,0:04:30.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This land is strong.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.43,0:04:36.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Through it all, Yuba lives on.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.50,0:04:43.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This sand storm\Nwill deal Yuba a final,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,destructive blow.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.39,0:04:48.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fanning the flames of anger\Nwithin the rebel army
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.91,0:04:51.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,until an inferno ignites.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.69,0:04:56.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But in the end,\Nthe bleeding hearts
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.36,0:04:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which infest this land\Nare what's killing it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.93,0:05:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you, Straw Hat Luffy, are the worst of them all.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.37,0:05:07.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If only you had purged yourself of such weakness,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.30,0:05:09.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you may have lived a little longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.44,0:05:12.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.21,0:05:17.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I assume you don't feel so indebted to this water now.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.26,0:05:33.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this? You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That looks like it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you'll be out of\Nyour misery soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:07.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was a complete\Nwaste of my time.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.29,0:06:29.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not so bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.56,0:06:31.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once we've weathered this storm,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.40,0:06:34.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the rain will bless\Nus with sweet relief.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.20,0:06:35.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just like always.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.87,0:06:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your winds will never\Nvanquish us, you cowardly storm!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.02,0:06:45.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3770,4670,1,\c&H171816&\3c&H171816&\4c&H171816&)}Yuba will never give in to the sand!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.02,0:06:57.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me, go to Alubarna?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.89,0:07:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are we chasing after\Nthe Straw Hat pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.46,0:07:04.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or, uh, reinforcing\Nthe royal army?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.39,0:07:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's up to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.96,0:07:09.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll have to decide\Nwhich is more important
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when you get there.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.79,0:07:14.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But Sir. I don't understand.\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.13,0:07:16.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rely on your sense of justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.77,0:07:21.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I'll accept responsibility.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain, where are you going?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.67,0:07:25.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to head out to sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.02,0:07:27.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something unforeseen has come up.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.99,0:07:29.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be on alert to receive\Ncommunication from me
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.94,0:07:31.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at any time.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.12,0:07:32.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.96,0:07:35.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need you to keep a\Nvigilant eye on this country
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.17,0:07:36.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and where it ends up.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.59,0:07:41.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whether it falls,\Nor whether it survives.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.89,0:07:44.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The dawn of a brand\Nnew and historic age
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.09,0:07:45.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is on the horizon.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.70,0:07:55.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major. Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.97,0:07:57.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(485,1053)}– Your orders?\N– Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.52,0:08:02.72,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Whether it falls,\Nor whether it survives.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.96,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The dawn of a brand\Nnew and historic age
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.99,0:08:06.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,is on the horizon.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.60,0:08:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our target is the\Npirate Straw Hat Luffy,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.84,0:08:17.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and everyone who\Nserves under him!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.80,0:08:21.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All hands reinforce your gear!\NPrepare to depart for Alubarna!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.94,0:08:22.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Right!\N– Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.63,0:08:36.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Cobra!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.69,0:08:39.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My brethren and I are\Nwilling to defend Alabasta
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.20,0:08:41.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with every last drop\Nof blood in our bodies.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will die before\Nturning it over to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:52.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Step lively!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.86,0:08:56.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the southern gate!\NStop dawdling around and focus!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.30,0:08:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We need more cannonballs over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:02.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.80,0:09:07.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The enemy's number is said\Nto be well over two million!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, soldier, what do\Nyou think of His Majesty's
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.91,0:09:12.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,attack on Nanohana?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.51,0:09:14.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have served his Majesty\Nfor over ten years
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.78,0:09:16.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I was quite surprised.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.57,0:09:17.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.67,0:09:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's really no way anyone could rationalize it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.50,0:09:23.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Logic would suggest something\Nhas happened to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:26.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If true...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.12,0:09:28.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is all the more reason\Nwhy we must not
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.22,0:09:29.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,lose this fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.79,0:09:31.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bury your fear deep.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For your King's sake.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.61,0:09:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As well as that\Nof Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.31,0:09:39.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will defend this\Ncountry at all cost!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.62,0:09:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Everyone who is not prepared to fight
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.49,0:09:43.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,take shelter outside the city!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.39,0:09:45.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We cannot guarantee your\Nsafety if you elect to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:46.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't get outta here,\Nwe'll be in the line of fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.01,0:09:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Things are getting\Nhectic down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:54.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.64,0:09:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's still moving too slow.\NHurry up and fight already!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't stand waiting!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.25,0:10:06.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't take this.\NI really don't care if he is
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.52,0:10:07.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or isn't the king.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.70,0:10:09.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go outta my mind\Nif I have to stand here
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.70,0:10:10.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,guarding him any longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.87,0:10:13.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cant. Can't. Can't take this.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.75,0:10:15.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.69,0:10:16.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, slipping past
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.02,0:10:18.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the palace guards\Nand kidnapping this royal
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.82,0:10:20.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,pain-in-the-rear is a\Nmission which only a team
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.67,0:10:22.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of our accomplished\Nskills could pull off.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.47,0:10:24.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, now that it's over,\Nthis assignment has
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.34,0:10:25.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,become a tedious bore!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, Mr. 4?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.80,0:10:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did anything I said\Nmanage to seep through
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that thick head of yours?\NSlow, you're so slow.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My back is killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chaka. Koza.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.36,0:10:38.53,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You mustn't fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.55,0:10:41.98,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The two of you embody the spirit of this great country.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.02,0:10:44.52,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Divided, you only weaken her resolve.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.79,0:10:49.49,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,There are those\Nwho lament war...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.01,0:10:57.35,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,...and those\Nwho race towards it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.74,0:11:06.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just go ahead and run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:07.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.68,0:11:13.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Still, others incite war.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.35,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,But for the very few who know the truth,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.38,0:11:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they strive to prevent it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.41,0:11:22.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These widely opposing viewpoints\Nall have one thing in common.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.08,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,They are about to clash,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.11,0:11:26.68,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,here in the capital\Ncity of Alubarna.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.84,0:11:32.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.81,0:11:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean we\Ncan't cross this river?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.91,0:11:35.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.78,0:11:37.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Moving Crabs are\Ncreatures of the desert.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.68,0:11:38.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They don't take to water.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.80,0:11:40.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Has everyone gone nuts?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.50,0:11:44.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a crab! They can exist\Non land and water!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.72,0:11:46.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys, this is not good!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.14,0:11:48.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a serious problem!\NLook!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we just carelessly spend our energy
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.86,0:11:52.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,swimming across the river,\Nwe're not gonna make it in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.56,0:11:53.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See here?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After the river,\Nthere's tons of desert
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to deal with!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.10,0:11:58.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, if this crab can't make it\Nto the other shore,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.07,0:12:00.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are we supposed to run\Nthe rest of the way on foot?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.69,0:12:01.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.86,0:12:03.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We won't make it in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely impossible!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.40,0:12:15.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. Hey, I can see it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sandora River straight ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.09,0:12:17.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.84,0:12:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help us, Scissors!\NPretty please!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.51,0:12:23.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know.\NScissors loves dancer girls.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.74,0:12:26.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will this do?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.85,0:12:27.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.52,0:12:29.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! I can't take it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's looking this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.00,0:12:37.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're accelerating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami swan!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great! Now we've\Ngot two animals in heat!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.91,0:12:47.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right! We're moving now!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.51,0:12:52.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what exactly\Nhas this solved, Chopper?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:01.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:05.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.43,0:13:08.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing it,\Nbut I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.23,0:13:09.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This crab is incredible!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.90,0:13:11.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.90,0:13:14.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, don't you stop!\NJust keep on going. Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.87,0:13:17.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run, run, run all the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go! Keep moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.94,0:13:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop us now!\NOh! I love this crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.58,0:13:26.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I didn't know better,\NI'd think we were sinking!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.26,0:13:33.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stupid crab!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.06,0:13:33.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.96,0:13:37.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No use whining about it.\NKeep moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.22,0:13:38.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.25,0:13:40.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure there aren't\Nany boats around here?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.26,0:13:42.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How long will it take us to reach the shore?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.10,0:13:43.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rest of the night.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.48,0:13:44.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.66,0:13:50.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ride.\NBye, Scissors.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.69,0:13:53.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up! He's the reason\Nwe're in this mess!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.56,0:13:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,900)}What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.45,0:14:01.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a Sandoran catfish!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.95,0:14:03.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're rarely seen by humans!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.65,0:14:05.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem that rare to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did I mention they\Nlove to eat human flesh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.32,0:14:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You could've\Ntold us a bit sooner!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, dammit!\NI can't see a thing
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.04,0:14:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with you hanging on\Nso tight! Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.52,0:14:33.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kung Fu Dugongs?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.62,0:14:36.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They say they\Nwere just looking out for
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.98,0:14:38.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,their fellow pupils.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.42,0:14:39.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pupils?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.39,0:14:41.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, they think Luffy's\Nour master? Please.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.96,0:14:43.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really want\Nto argue with them?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.56,0:14:44.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,450)}Hang in there, little guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,450)}Just a little further!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.84,0:14:48.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.53,0:14:49.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.75,0:14:54.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that things are going smoothly,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.05,0:14:55.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,can we make it in time?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.59,0:14:56.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.49,0:14:58.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even riding Eyelash,\NI'm not sure when
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.56,0:14:59.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we would get there.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.66,0:15:01.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to be pessimistic,\Nbut Eyelash can only
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.73,0:15:02.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,carry two of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If Baroque Works\Nis going to attack us,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.13,0:15:06.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it'll be from here on,\Nso we can't split up.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.73,0:15:09.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way for us to stick together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.61,0:15:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn. This isn't good.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.75,0:15:19.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look! Over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.05,0:15:20.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it now?\NIs it the enemy?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.82,0:15:23.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're here to kill us already!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.12,0:15:27.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No wait! That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:28.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.64,0:15:30.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the Supersonic\NDuck Squadron!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.77,0:15:37.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've come to\Nhelp us, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.55,0:15:39.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:04.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.23,0:16:14.04,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We may both be pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.57,0:16:18.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But you fall grossly\Nshort on skill.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.34,0:16:20.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This sand storm will\Ndeal Yuba a final,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:22.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,destructive blow.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.81,0:16:25.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Fanning the flames of anger\Nwithin the rebel army
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,until an inferno ignites.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.15,0:17:16.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank... Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.42,0:17:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do you fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those of you with\Nthe name of "D."
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.17,0:17:35.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"D"?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.48,0:17:38.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.41,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What are your intentions?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.45,0:17:44.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Apparently,\Nyou don't have a clue
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.19,0:17:45.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.29,0:17:52.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.30,0:18:00.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where is Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:01.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.22,0:18:04.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awake already?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.99,0:18:07.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that I've\Nstudied your ability,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.04,0:18:09.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this won't turn out\Nlike it did last time!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.49,0:18:12.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Pell.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna overexert yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.07,0:18:22.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.44,0:18:25.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you save the boy before he dies?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.86,0:18:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, if it weren't\Nfor his courage
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.10,0:18:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and selflessness, who knows\Nif your precious princess
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.20,0:18:35.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,would've made\Nit back alive at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.27,0:18:38.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It must please you to know Vivi's safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.16,0:18:41.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That even as we speak, she's on her way to Alubarna.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.13,0:18:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Though it's a long trip,\Nand anything could happen.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.84,0:18:46.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess the situation is what it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.15,0:19:02.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I'm not able to\Nstop her, then who can?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.46,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi must be protected for everyone's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.23,0:19:13.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.48,0:19:16.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, the final revolt has begun.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.52,0:19:18.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There was a lone ship.\NHopefully that means
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.66,0:19:20.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi and the others\Nwere able to make it
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to Alabasta in one piece.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.03,0:19:26.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must hurry.\NI pray there's still time.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.11,0:19:30.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.34,0:19:31.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Need meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:37.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.45,0:19:40.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meat? You don't need food now.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.25,0:19:42.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the least of your worries.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.22,0:19:44.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hang on.\NI'll get a doctor for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.76,0:19:52.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am going to make\Nsure Crocodile pays for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.40,0:19:58.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He insulted Vivi,\Nand that old man
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.14,0:20:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with the shovel\Nwho gave me water.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's definitely gonna pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.21,0:20:07.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is this person?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.92,0:20:11.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.97,0:20:33.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.97,0:20:36.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's still in the distance, but it's Alubarna!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.37,0:20:39.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Koza! We're less than\Nthirty minutes away.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.97,0:20:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.62,0:20:44.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're nearing Alubarna now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.34,0:20:46.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The time has come, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.64,0:20:53.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chaka, we've sighted\Nthe rebel army.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.51,0:20:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're about ten\Nmiles to the south!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.47,0:20:57.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Their forces are bearing\Ndown on the southern gate
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.48,0:20:58.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as we speak!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.88,0:21:02.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,East. West. South.\NSoutheast. Southwest!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.85,0:21:05.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guard each gate with your life!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.20,0:21:08.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not let even one of them set foot within our walls!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.53,0:21:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Right!\N– Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.35,0:21:27.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, take a look over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.32,0:21:29.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rebel army is approaching!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.39,0:21:31.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there are so many of them!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.32,0:21:33.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The princess is\Nsuch a little idiot
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.23,0:21:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to think she can stop them!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.63,0:21:37.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But then, is the little idiot even coming?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.38,0:21:39.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really, now will she show up?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.40,0:21:43.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or will she not? Or will she?\NOr will she not?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.42,0:21:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The outcome is vague!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.59,0:21:46.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, what, what, what, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.32,0:21:48.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are we sure about this?\NShouldn't we be sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.44,0:21:50.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The princess and the pirates\Nare really coming, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.30,0:21:52.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the rebel army\Nis going to beat them here!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.37,0:21:54.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought those idiots wanted to stop the fighting!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.54,0:21:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't they at least try to be on time?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.35,0:21:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it's entirely possible
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.68,0:21:59.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that they won't\Nmake it soon enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.68,0:22:01.42,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It might even be likely, really.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.44,0:22:02.88,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}After all, they did\Nlose precious time
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.88,0:22:04.22,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}when they were in Rainbase.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:06.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? They did?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.21,0:22:08.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, then.\NLet's suppose the rebellion
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.22,0:22:09.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,does get started first.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.40,0:22:12.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to\Ndeux if that does happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.51,0:22:15.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have to "deux"\Nanything, would we?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.11,0:22:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think about it. Once the\Nrebellion gets under way,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.12,0:22:18.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's nothing even\Nthe princess will be able
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.68,0:22:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to do to stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.19,0:22:21.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All we need to do is eliminate
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.76,0:22:23.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,whoever we're told to.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.59,0:22:25.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't you even manage\Nto figure that much out
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.79,0:22:26.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on your own?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.79,0:22:28.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sounds like\Nyou're just dying to see
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.49,0:22:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,some of my dance moves.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.70,0:22:32.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just calm down\Nand let it go, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.19,0:22:33.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My back. It hurts!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.53,0:22:35.43,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Get over here and\Nmassage it, Mr. 4!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.45,0:22:40.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're... com... ing... now.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.22,0:22:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.50,0:22:44.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us\Nthat earlier, you idiot?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.90,0:22:50.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ducks! They're on ducks?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.72,0:22:52.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're on ducks?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.35,0:22:54.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?\NDo you see anything else?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.94,0:22:56.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems like their\Nnumber's gone up, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.78,0:22:58.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are six of 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.11,0:22:59.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With Straw Hat out of the way,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.24,0:23:02.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought there was only\Nsupposed to be four left.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.61,0:23:04.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not quite, Miss Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what the boss said?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.54,0:23:09.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He told us there's that Mr. Prince guy, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.24,0:23:10.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And apparently there's\Nmore than one of him,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.75,0:23:12.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so the numbers do add up.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just do the math.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.32,0:23:15.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.65,0:23:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi is our only target.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.52,0:23:21.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.32,0:23:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr. 1.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.66,0:23:27.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You say Princess Vivi is the\Nonly one we need to eliminate?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.66,0:23:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.56,0:23:32.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then how 'bout you\Ntake a stab at guessing
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which one she is!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.40,0:23:36.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're all wearing\Nidentical outfits!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even worse, those birds\Nare the quickest
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.56,0:23:41.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Supersonic ducks!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.45,0:23:49.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those sneaky rats!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.85,0:23:51.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How're we supposed\Nto tell which one is Vivi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.45,0:23:56.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}It's just not a fair thing to do, you know?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.23,0:24:08.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let them have it now, MR. 4!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.27,0:24:13.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dodge it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.39,0:24:17.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Missed them!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.26,0:24:19.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those damn birds!\NThey're too fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.90,0:24:22.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Two just broke off from the rest!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.66,0:24:24.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're splitting up!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.43,0:24:26.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're planning\Nto go for the south gate.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.80,0:24:29.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Those two are heading straight\Ntoward the rebel army.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.48,0:24:31.92,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means one\Nof them must be Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.95,0:24:34.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll go ahead and\Ntake care of those two.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.49,0:24:35.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move it, Mr. 4!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.61,0:24:41.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special attack! Fire star!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.37,0:24:47.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Two more of them\Nare breaking off that way,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.34,0:24:49.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 1. That could be Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.70,0:24:52.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems they're planning to go in through the west gate.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.48,0:24:55.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn brats. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.69,0:24:59.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un... Deux!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.56,0:25:02.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's head\Nfor the southwest gate now!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.74,0:25:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So they're going to approach three
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.03,0:25:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of Alubarna's five\Ngates from the west?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.43,0:25:11.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If they're gonna split up and enter that way,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.94,0:25:13.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then we'll do the same thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.12,0:25:14.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can wipe them\Nout inside the city!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.44,0:25:18.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from me!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.49,0:25:24.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.96,0:25:26.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it the rebels?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.38,0:25:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.77,0:25:29.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the Supersonic\NDuck Squadron!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.77,0:25:30.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let them in!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.59,0:25:46.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}I'm not kidding here!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.89,0:25:49.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}There's no way you're getting away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.76,0:25:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Four. Four. Four. Four.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.64,0:26:05.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tee hee hee! Thank you\Nso much for following us
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:06.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all the way here.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.98,0:26:08.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.99,0:26:13.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now! Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.22,0:26:16.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, you guys\Nare very good, you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.56,0:26:18.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NI'm the real Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.75,0:26:21.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you...I mean,\Nwhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.26,0:26:23.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the real Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.60,0:26:28.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this\Nis far enough now.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.24,0:26:35.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to say, it's\Nreally entertaining how easily
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.88,0:26:37.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you all fell for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.70,0:26:41.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now. We can go ahead and\Ntake these silly cloaks off.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.97,0:26:45.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Too bad! It looks like your guess was wrong!\N– Too bad! It looks like your guess was wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.91,0:26:51.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.15,0:27:00.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.25,0:27:03.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry now.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.76,0:27:05.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rebel army\Nis almost to the city!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.59,0:27:08.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.65,0:27:12.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Camel?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.62,0:27:15.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I recognize you from the ship, too, don't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.62,0:27:17.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.62,0:27:19.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on, Zoro,\Nlet 'em have it!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.16,0:27:21.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you keep quiet over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.25,0:27:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They fooled us.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.22,0:27:24.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quite a farce.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.22,0:27:26.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't owe that\Nanymore! You cleared me!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.66,0:27:29.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like there\Nwon't be any rebellion now.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.76,0:27:31.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.13,0:27:36.23,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to stop them at any cost.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.27,0:27:39.77,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I don't, then all of this\Nstruggling has been for nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.03,0:27:43.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever the cost,\NVivi and her friends
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.13,0:27:45.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,must be prevented\Nfrom making contact
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.07,0:27:46.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,with the rebel army.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.83,0:27:55.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Secure the cannonballs!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't want them rolling away!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.44,0:27:58.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You heard him, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.77,0:28:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man your posts! Keep the\Nartillery under control!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.84,0:28:04.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ground is really moving, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.71,0:28:07.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The enemy army is made up of two million angry men.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.68,0:28:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even the ground shakes a little before them.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.11,0:28:11.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stay strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.67,0:28:24.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Karoo,\Nyou don't have to be here.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.61,0:28:31.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You could get trampled, so just be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.79,0:28:43.96,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, Leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.99,0:28:45.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Please listen to what I have to say.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.86,0:28:47.46,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You must hear it.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.80,0:28:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone listen!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.24,0:28:56.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Close your ranks and stay together!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.24,0:28:58.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll knock through the guards at the southern gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.94,0:29:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rest will fall from there!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.24,0:29:03.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not lose heart!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.56,0:29:13.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rebel army, you must stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.99,0:29:16.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This fight is pointless!\NIt's all a set-up!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.96,0:29:22.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please slow down!\NYou have got to listen to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.64,0:29:36.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Did you see a person\Nstanding in front of us
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.00,0:29:37.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.87,0:29:38.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Person?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.57,0:29:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That isn't important right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.24,0:29:42.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The enemy is already shooting at us!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.08,0:29:48.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did they do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.37,0:29:50.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neither side can see anything now!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.07,0:29:54.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is the royal army thinking?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.87,0:29:57.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.81,0:30:00.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't given anyone the order to open fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.61,0:30:02.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not act without my say-so!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.28,0:30:05.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, sir!\NI'm terribly sorry about that!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.11,0:30:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess my hand just slipped!\NSorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.10,0:30:29.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't back down!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.17,0:30:30.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Charge through!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.27,0:30:32.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just a cloud of sand.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:32.34,0:30:35.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, everyone!\NYou have to stop now!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.14,0:30:39.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll make the king pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.85,0:30:40.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.69,0:30:52.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.68,0:31:02.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Koza. What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.18,0:31:04.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:06.32,0:31:07.69,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Was I imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.87,0:31:22.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.93,0:31:25.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.93,0:31:27.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Today will be our final battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.42,0:31:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.76,0:31:36.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:53.35,0:31:54.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:55.65,0:31:57.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cannons ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:02.99,0:32:05.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:23.00,0:32:24.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Save the country!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:25.81,0:32:27.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tear down Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.43,0:32:58.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, Karoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:01.40,0:33:02.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.66,0:33:08.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You shielded me from them.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:11.77,0:33:13.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.44,0:33:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've come so far.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:15.17,0:33:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've done so much,\Nbut the rebellion has started.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:19.86,0:33:21.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:21.46,0:33:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I will still stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:23.17,0:33:25.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times they refuse to listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:26.03,0:33:28.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter how loudly I have to yell.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:28.18,0:33:30.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will not let mindless\Nfighting destroy
Dialogue: 50,0:33:30.30,0:33:32.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what we've worked so hard for.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:32.14,0:33:36.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's something I learned\Nwhile I was onboard the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:36.19,0:33:37.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not ever give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.81,0:33:42.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(497,1053)}Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:43.78,0:33:45.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At last! I found you!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:45.55,0:33:46.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:46.98,0:33:48.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can still make it in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:48.75,0:33:49.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry and hop on!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:50.04,0:33:50.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:51.02,0:33:52.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Karoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:52.62,0:33:54.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget about that bird.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:56.16,0:33:59.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Vivi? Come\Non. We need to get going now!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:59.06,0:34:00.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:03.83,0:34:06.87,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That... bird?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:10.14,0:34:11.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:16.36,0:34:17.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:17.17,0:34:19.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rebellion will\Nonly get worse.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:22.11,0:34:24.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp...
Dialogue: 50,0:34:24.35,0:34:26.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Prove yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:26.27,0:34:27.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:27.93,0:34:29.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't believe that it's me?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:31.72,0:34:32.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.85,0:34:33.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:35.82,0:34:37.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Hey, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:37.79,0:34:39.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eyelash! Wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:39.72,0:34:41.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:41.70,0:34:43.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it morning already?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.04,0:34:44.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:44.34,0:34:46.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, this is how\Nour fight turned out.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:46.74,0:34:48.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The part of the mission\Nwhere we lured them away
Dialogue: 50,0:34:48.68,0:34:50.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,went really well,\Nbut then...
Dialogue: 50,0:34:50.88,0:34:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 50,0:34:52.85,0:34:54.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then it was over in two seconds.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:54.72,0:34:56.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One second each.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:56.82,0:34:58.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have held out longer?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:00.15,0:35:02.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:02.25,0:35:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your ducks got me.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:03.12,0:35:05.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They came to get some help for you two.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:05.19,0:35:06.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that aside...
Dialogue: 50,0:35:06.36,0:35:08.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You let Mr. 2 get\Naway, didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:08.92,0:35:09.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:15.03,0:35:16.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:16.10,0:35:18.67,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That creepy ballerina's transformations are perfect.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:18.70,0:35:19.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no telling\Nwhen he might pose
Dialogue: 50,0:35:20.00,0:35:22.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,as one of us and make\Nan attempt on Vivi's life.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:22.27,0:35:24.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Does everyone understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:24.43,0:35:27.20,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If you ever feel like one of us is acting suspicious...
Dialogue: 50,0:35:29.80,0:35:31.27,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...ask them to take\Noff this wrapping,
Dialogue: 50,0:35:31.30,0:35:32.70,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,reveal their mark.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:32.74,0:35:34.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If they can't do that,\Nthey're an imposter.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:34.89,0:35:35.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:35.89,0:35:37.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Having such a well\Nthought out plan like this
Dialogue: 50,0:35:37.82,0:35:40.63,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,seems uncharacteristically\Nsmart for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:40.64,0:35:43.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,So how can we be sure you aren't already an imposter?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:43.70,0:35:44.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll stab you!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:44.80,0:35:46.17,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:46.18,0:35:48.18,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Whew! Definitely Zoro.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:54.91,0:35:56.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:56.38,0:35:58.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not really Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:59.83,0:36:01.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:03.26,0:36:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, really! You knew? How?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:06.90,0:36:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought my imitation was perfect.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:10.44,0:36:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We even had a helpful report from the boss
Dialogue: 50,0:36:12.34,0:36:14.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that you all had the same\Nbandages wrapped up
Dialogue: 50,0:36:14.17,0:36:15.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on your arm like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:15.84,0:36:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So smart of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:18.98,0:36:20.18,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:21.92,0:36:23.35,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi's in danger!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
